ol unit (T0-T8) with control ","sz":18.0},{"text":"i","sz":18.0},{"text":"/","sz":18.0},{"text":"ps","sz":18.0},{"text":" C0-C9 as below:","sz":18.0}]},{"runs":[{"text":"C0 = C1 = C2 = T0","sz":18.0}]},{"runs":[{"text":"C3 = T1","sz":18.0}]},{"runs":[{"text":"C4 = T3","sz":18.0}]},{"runs":[{"text":"C5  = T3 + T4","sz":18.0}]},{"runs":[{"text":"C6 = C7 = T5","sz":18.0}]},{"runs":[{"text":"C8 =T6","sz":18.0}]},{"runs":[{"text":"C9 = T7","sz":18.0}]}],"anchor":"t"}]},{"bg":null,"items":[{"t":"text","box":[0.7046,0.8809,0.056,0.0532],"paras":[{"runs":[{"text":"24","sz":18.0}]}],"anchor":"t"},{"t":"text","box":[0.0241,0.1984,0.9759,0.7695],"paras":[{"runs":[{"text":"A) Design a hardwired CU for the RTD given below. Establish all the control points and design the controller using appropriate counter, decoder and sequence controller. Also,  provide the implementation of sequence controller using PLA.","sz":25.9}]},{"runs":[{"text":"B) Give the binary listing of the microprogram for the Register Transfer Description given below. Show all the necessary steps to arrive at the binary listing.","sz":25.9}]},{"runs":[{"text":"\t\tDeclare registers A[8], B[8]\t","sz":25.9}]},{"runs":[{"text":"\t\tDeclare ","sz":25.9},{"text":"inbus","sz":25.9},{"text":"[8], ","sz":25.9},{"text":"outbus","sz":25.9},{"text":"[8];","sz":25.9}]},{"runs":[{"text":"\t\tSTART: \tA","sz":25.9},{"text":" ","sz":18.5},{"text":"\u2190","sz":33.3},{"text":" ","sz":18.5},{"text":"inbus","sz":25.9},{"text":", B","sz":25.9},{"text":" ","sz":18.5},{"text":"\u2190 ","sz":33.3},{"text":"0;","sz":25.9}]},{"runs":[{"text":"\t\tBACK:\tIf A[0]=0 then go to ADD;","sz":25.9}]},{"runs":[{"text":"\t\tgo to NEXT;","sz":25.9}]},{"runs":[{"text":"\t\tADD: \tB","sz":25.9},{"text":"\u2190 ","sz":32.4},{"text":"B+A;","sz":25.9}]},{"runs":[{"text":"\t\tNEXT:\tA","sz":25.9},{"text":" \u2190 ","sz":35.1},{"text":"A-1;","sz":25.9}]},{"runs":[{"text":"\t\tIf A>0 then go to BACK; ","sz":25.9}]},{"runs":[{"text":"\t\t","sz":25.9},{"te